# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Open Generative AI — example environment file
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# ⚠️  This app follows a BYOK ("Bring Your Own Key") model.
#     You DO NOT need to configure any API key here.
#
#     Each user pastes their own MuAPI key in ⚙️ Settings, and it is stored
#     ONLY in the browser (localStorage). It is never read from the server,
#     never written to disk, and never committed to the repository.
#
# There are currently no required environment variables to run this project.
# This file exists only to document that fact and to hold future NON-SECRET
# configuration if it is ever needed.
#
# Example (optional, non-secret) — override the upstream MuAPI base URL:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MUAPI_BASE_URL=https://api.muapi.ai
